# AI Stream Assistant — Cursor Rules

Follow `docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`, `docs/PROJECT_RULES.md`, and `docs/AGENT_RULES.md`.

## Hard requirements

- Default LLM: `google/gemini-3.5-flash-lite` via OpenRouter **backend only**.
- No silent mock success when API fails; demo mode must be explicit.
- Settings fields: `openrouter_api_key`, `selected_model`, `kick_channel_id`, `twitch_channel_id`, `youtube_channel_id`, `custom_prompt_override`. Use `PUT /settings`.
- Simulator: `{ interval_seconds }`.
- English-only product copy for now.
- Prefer fixing live connectors and contracts over decorative UI.
